1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:01:33,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

2
00:01:36,345 --> 00:01:38,985
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:01:40,865 --> 00:01:41,865
Not bad.

4
00:01:41,945 --> 00:01:42,785
-Show me.
-Have a look.

5
00:01:42,865 --> 00:01:44,545
Okay. Let's see.

6
00:01:46,625 --> 00:01:47,705
These photos turned out so well.

7
00:01:47,785 --> 00:01:48,745
Don't you think so?

8
00:01:49,625 --> 00:01:52,185
Thank you for the past six years
all the best.

9
00:01:52,265 --> 00:01:53,625
This one's nice too.

10
00:01:56,625 --> 00:01:59,385
Mom, is today some special occasion?

11
00:01:59,465 --> 00:02:01,025
What occasion?

12
00:02:01,105 --> 00:02:03,305
It's the wedding anniversary
of your dad and me.

13
00:02:06,745 --> 00:02:07,585
Hello.

14
00:02:07,665 --> 00:02:09,785
The number you've dialed
is not in service.

15
00:02:09,864 --> 00:02:11,705
Please check the number and try again.

16
00:02:16,705 --> 00:02:18,465
What's wrong? Is anything bothering you?

17
00:02:18,985 --> 00:02:19,825
Nothing.

18
00:02:19,905 --> 00:02:25,745
Say, when are you arranging for us
to meet Shang Zhitao?

19
00:02:27,345 --> 00:02:29,985
She's from Harbin, isn't she?

20
00:02:30,065 --> 00:02:31,545
How about we fly to Harbin

21
00:02:31,625 --> 00:02:35,465
and meet her parents
during the Chinese New Year?

22
00:02:35,545 --> 00:02:37,465
Once we've met,

23
00:02:37,545 --> 00:02:39,745
we can get
the wedding arrangements underway.

24
00:02:39,825 --> 00:02:41,585
We've broken up.

25
00:02:42,505 --> 00:02:43,345
What?

26
00:02:43,425 --> 00:02:45,985
I told you. It's all messed up.

27
00:02:48,105 --> 00:02:49,785
Don't listen to your dad.

28
00:02:50,625 --> 00:02:53,505
Nian, is it because you're moving
to the US for work,

29
00:02:53,585 --> 00:02:54,585
and she isn't happy with that?

30
00:02:55,705 --> 00:02:57,825
No. Don't worry about it.

31
00:02:58,385 --> 00:03:02,825
Silly boy, be nicer to her.

32
00:03:03,345 --> 00:03:05,065
Don't be so grouchy.

33
00:03:05,585 --> 00:03:08,625
If I remember correctly,
you've been together for years.

34
00:03:09,465 --> 00:03:12,305
You have to cherish her.
Do you understand, Nian?

35
00:03:13,665 --> 00:03:14,625
I know.

36
00:03:22,985 --> 00:03:26,585
THE NUMBER YOU DIALED IS NOT IN SERVICE

37
00:03:47,225 --> 00:03:48,065
Luke.

38
00:03:49,225 --> 00:03:51,305
Weren't you leaving for the US?
When do you fly?

39
00:03:51,385 --> 00:03:52,385
Where's your mentee?

40
00:03:54,385 --> 00:03:55,225
She resigned.

41
00:03:55,905 --> 00:03:56,865
Resigned?

42
00:04:03,345 --> 00:04:04,185
How does it look?

43
00:04:05,585 --> 00:04:07,425
Flora sold it to me for half price.

44
00:04:07,505 --> 00:04:11,025
She was selling all her designer bags
at the company's flea market.

45
00:04:11,545 --> 00:04:13,145
She never said where she was going.

46
00:04:13,225 --> 00:04:14,745
She changed her number.

47
00:04:14,825 --> 00:04:16,305
She only said she'd get in touch someday.

48
00:04:30,785 --> 00:04:31,945
I want to know

49
00:04:32,585 --> 00:04:35,425
why no one reported
a key employee's resignation to me.

50
00:04:36,625 --> 00:04:38,625
You're talking about Flora's resignation.

51
00:04:38,705 --> 00:04:40,665
I just want to know
why the key employee's resignation

52
00:04:40,745 --> 00:04:41,785
never came across my desk.

53
00:04:45,985 --> 00:04:47,745
You made the rules.

54
00:04:47,825 --> 00:04:50,105
Anyone below Specialist level only needs
approval from the department head.

55
00:04:51,025 --> 00:04:52,385
Flora wasn't a Specialist.

56
00:04:53,345 --> 00:04:56,625
Besides, you're transferring to the US.

57
00:04:56,705 --> 00:04:59,585
HR in China
isn't your responsibility anymore.

58
00:05:04,425 --> 00:05:06,225
You knew about us.

59
00:05:06,305 --> 00:05:07,545
Shouldn't you have told me?

60
00:05:07,625 --> 00:05:09,905
I tried to convince her to stay.

61
00:05:09,985 --> 00:05:11,585
But she told me
there was nothing between you anymore.

62
00:05:11,665 --> 00:05:14,105
So tell me,
what position was I supposed to take?

63
00:05:34,545 --> 00:05:35,785
This suicide video

64
00:05:36,305 --> 00:05:38,385
has been making the rounds.

65
00:05:39,145 --> 00:05:40,305
They say the man jumped
because the pressure became too much.

66
00:05:41,785 --> 00:05:42,905
This person

67
00:05:43,865 --> 00:05:45,425
seems to be Flora's friend.

68
00:05:58,945 --> 00:06:01,705
Sun Yu and I
are catching a midnight movie later.

69
00:06:02,625 --> 00:06:03,905
Is Sun Yuanzhu not going?

70
00:06:05,225 --> 00:06:06,825
I lost my best friend.

71
00:06:06,905 --> 00:06:09,185
I lost the competition I should've won.

72
00:06:18,545 --> 00:06:20,105
What's the victim's name?

73
00:06:20,745 --> 00:06:22,385
Out of respect for the victim's privacy,

74
00:06:23,025 --> 00:06:24,625
they didn't release the name.

75
00:06:25,425 --> 00:06:27,865
I heard the surname was Sun.

76
00:06:54,345 --> 00:06:55,305
Where's Shang Zhitao?

77
00:06:56,545 --> 00:06:57,705
She left.

78
00:06:58,625 --> 00:07:00,865
She left quickly and decisively.

79
00:07:01,665 --> 00:07:03,105
She even changed her phone number.

80
00:07:04,145 --> 00:07:06,265
But she said
she'd get in touch with me later.

81
00:07:14,425 --> 00:07:15,265
Hello?

82
00:07:15,785 --> 00:07:16,785
Help me find someone.

83
00:07:19,705 --> 00:07:20,625
Shang Zhitao.

84
00:07:22,305 --> 00:07:24,385
She quit Lime without a word.

85
00:08:03,145 --> 00:08:05,865
Shang Zhitao has probably decided
to move back home.

86
00:08:27,305 --> 00:08:28,465
You're an adult.

87
00:08:29,265 --> 00:08:30,585
If you say it's over,

88
00:08:31,865 --> 00:08:33,264
then don't ever start it again.

89
00:08:35,545 --> 00:08:36,784
I never will.

90
00:08:48,945 --> 00:08:49,785
Luke.

91
00:08:58,945 --> 00:08:59,825
Grateful pup.

92
00:09:07,065 --> 00:09:08,385
You should go with her.

93
00:09:50,305 --> 00:09:52,985
HARBIN

94
00:09:57,105 --> 00:10:00,145
OLD COUPLE'S TAVERN

95
00:10:00,225 --> 00:10:01,745
Slow down.

96
00:10:04,585 --> 00:10:06,785
Mom said you were hopping around.

97
00:10:06,865 --> 00:10:08,625
Now look at you.

98
00:10:08,705 --> 00:10:11,945
Even young people need time to recover
from an injury like this.

99
00:10:12,985 --> 00:10:15,025
A broken bone takes a hundred days.

100
00:10:15,105 --> 00:10:16,905
I'm in great shape.

101
00:10:16,985 --> 00:10:18,265
Other people need three to five months.

102
00:10:18,345 --> 00:10:19,545
I'll be back on my feet in two months.

103
00:10:19,625 --> 00:10:21,425
Oh, stop bluffing.

104
00:10:21,945 --> 00:10:25,185
He's so full of himself,
there's no cure for it.

105
00:10:25,705 --> 00:10:27,585
Just pipe down.

106
00:10:27,665 --> 00:10:30,465
You have to listen to the doctor's advice.

107
00:10:31,185 --> 00:10:32,065
I know.

108
00:10:38,225 --> 00:10:40,505
Your mom said you're staying
after Chinese New Year

109
00:10:41,385 --> 00:10:42,825
and finding a job in Harbin.

110
00:10:45,145 --> 00:10:46,265
What happened in Beijing?

111
00:10:47,545 --> 00:10:49,185
Weren't things going so well?

112
00:10:51,505 --> 00:10:53,025
What's wrong?

113
00:10:53,105 --> 00:10:55,745
I can take care of your dad.

114
00:10:56,265 --> 00:10:57,985
You don't have to come home.

115
00:10:58,065 --> 00:10:59,705
You're young.

116
00:10:59,785 --> 00:11:01,905
This is when you should be out
chasing your dreams.

117
00:11:02,545 --> 00:11:04,265
Your dad's always bragging about

118
00:11:04,345 --> 00:11:07,825
how amazing his daughter is.

119
00:11:07,905 --> 00:11:10,265
That you're doing so well in Beijing.

120
00:11:10,345 --> 00:11:12,985
We can't hold you back.

121
00:11:13,065 --> 00:11:14,705
We've talked about it.

122
00:11:14,785 --> 00:11:17,665
If we can't keep the tavern running,

123
00:11:18,425 --> 00:11:21,265
we'll just move into a retirement home.

124
00:11:21,345 --> 00:11:22,465
Come on.

125
00:11:22,545 --> 00:11:24,385
Why are you going to a retirement home?

126
00:11:24,465 --> 00:11:26,745
I'm fine. Beijing was fine too.

127
00:11:27,625 --> 00:11:29,265
It's just that

128
00:11:30,385 --> 00:11:32,145
I've moved from Harbin to Nanjing,

129
00:11:32,225 --> 00:11:33,945
then Nanjing to Beijing.

130
00:11:38,385 --> 00:11:39,505
I'm tired.

131
00:11:41,065 --> 00:11:43,145
I want to come home.
I want to spend time with you two.

132
00:11:43,225 --> 00:11:44,625
Aren't you happy I'm back?

133
00:11:45,345 --> 00:11:46,545
I have my friends here.

134
00:11:47,465 --> 00:11:49,345
My classmates are here.
You two are here, too.

135
00:11:49,865 --> 00:11:51,505
And my favorite snow.

136
00:11:53,625 --> 00:11:55,585
Alright. As long
as you've thought it through.

137
00:11:56,585 --> 00:11:58,465
My sweetheart is free to go
wherever she wants

138
00:11:58,545 --> 00:11:59,945
and do whatever she wants.

139
00:12:00,905 --> 00:12:02,345
You're always on my side, Dad.

140
00:12:02,905 --> 00:12:04,705
You're our only daughter.

141
00:12:04,785 --> 00:12:05,985
Who else would we love?

142
00:12:08,385 --> 00:12:10,225
Dad, Mom. Don't worry.

143
00:12:10,825 --> 00:12:14,465
I'll buy a little place here
and start my own business.

144
00:12:14,985 --> 00:12:16,025
Have faith in me.

145
00:12:17,185 --> 00:12:19,345
No matter where I am, I'll do just fine.

146
00:12:22,945 --> 00:12:25,025
Of course. My girl's amazing.

147
00:12:25,825 --> 00:12:26,865
Look at Mom.

148
00:12:27,385 --> 00:12:28,745
Look at her.

149
00:12:31,265 --> 00:12:33,945
NORWAY

150
00:12:51,745 --> 00:12:53,105
It's my first time seeing him like this.

151
00:12:54,265 --> 00:12:55,865
He really fell hard for her.

152
00:12:57,505 --> 00:12:58,985
I figured that out long ago.

153
00:12:59,985 --> 00:13:03,425
Have you ever seen him
get into a fight over a woman?

154
00:13:04,065 --> 00:13:06,225
He even flew back overnight from overseas
on New Year's Eve

155
00:13:06,305 --> 00:13:08,545
just to see Ms. Shang.

156
00:13:22,865 --> 00:13:24,265
Is that the aurora?

157
00:13:30,345 --> 00:13:31,545
It is.

158
00:13:33,745 --> 00:13:34,985
It's beautiful.

159
00:13:38,065 --> 00:13:39,105
Shang Zhitao.

160
00:13:40,825 --> 00:13:42,225
Shall we go see the aurora next year?

161
00:13:42,825 --> 00:13:43,705
Sure.

162
00:13:44,305 --> 00:13:45,625
I'll go wherever you go.

163
00:14:04,385 --> 00:14:07,625
Luan Nian, don't be sad.

164
00:14:08,145 --> 00:14:09,185
I want to praise you.

165
00:14:09,265 --> 00:14:10,505
I like you.

166
00:14:11,065 --> 00:14:13,185
I like every path you've chosen.

167
00:14:13,705 --> 00:14:15,265
I like going on adventures with you.

168
00:14:15,345 --> 00:14:17,105
I like all the beautiful places
we've seen.

169
00:14:17,185 --> 00:14:19,025
Because I saw them with you.

170
00:14:25,785 --> 00:14:26,865
Hello.

171
00:14:26,945 --> 00:14:28,785
The number you've dialed
is not in service.

172
00:14:28,865 --> 00:14:30,665
Please check the number and try again.

173
00:14:35,345 --> 00:14:36,425
Hello?

174
00:14:38,585 --> 00:14:39,665
Shang Zhitao.

175
00:14:42,065 --> 00:14:43,345
I'm watching the aurora.

176
00:14:45,105 --> 00:14:46,185
Do you remember?

177
00:14:47,785 --> 00:14:49,505
We said we'd see them together.

178
00:14:52,465 --> 00:14:53,785
But you disappeared.

179
00:14:58,145 --> 00:14:59,145
It's okay.

180
00:15:02,705 --> 00:15:03,865
I'll share them with you.

181
00:15:05,025 --> 00:15:06,625
You have to come see them someday.

182
00:15:07,625 --> 00:15:09,385
They're really beautiful.

183
00:15:15,505 --> 00:15:16,385
I'm sorry.

184
00:15:20,865 --> 00:15:22,465
I'm so sorry.

185
00:15:24,545 --> 00:15:26,225
There are so many things I'm sorry for.

186
00:15:27,665 --> 00:15:29,345
I know I'm a mess.

187
00:15:31,665 --> 00:15:32,905
I don't deserve to be loved.

188
00:15:36,585 --> 00:15:38,265
I just wanted to tell you,

189
00:15:40,785 --> 00:15:41,825
I miss you.

190
00:15:43,705 --> 00:15:45,185
I miss you so much.

191
00:15:50,105 --> 00:15:51,025
I love you.

192
00:15:52,305 --> 00:15:54,065
I love you.

193
00:15:59,265 --> 00:16:02,345
Hello. The number you've dialed
is not in service.

194
00:16:02,425 --> 00:16:04,225
Please check the number and try again.

195
00:16:24,625 --> 00:16:25,705
Luke,

196
00:16:25,785 --> 00:16:27,945
what's the point of calling a dead number
over and over?

197
00:16:29,585 --> 00:16:31,625
If you miss her, care about her,

198
00:16:32,225 --> 00:16:33,585
go find her.

199
00:16:34,505 --> 00:16:36,105
Book a flight.

200
00:16:37,625 --> 00:16:39,945
She threw away
everything that had to do with me.

201
00:16:42,745 --> 00:16:43,585
Forget it.

202
00:16:44,785 --> 00:16:45,785
Let's go get some sleep.

203
00:18:45,825 --> 00:18:49,305
Maybe when I broke up with Xin Zhaozhou,

204
00:18:49,385 --> 00:18:50,705
I was too young.

205
00:18:51,305 --> 00:18:54,505
Back then, I could let go easily.

206
00:18:55,505 --> 00:18:56,705
But this time,

207
00:18:56,785 --> 00:19:00,505
I finally understood
what it means to be cut by a dull knife.

208
00:19:01,505 --> 00:19:04,745
The breakup itself was quick

209
00:19:05,265 --> 00:19:06,425
and clean.

210
00:19:08,985 --> 00:19:10,345
But once it sank in,

211
00:19:11,065 --> 00:19:13,345
I'd think of him at most ordinary moments.

212
00:19:36,785 --> 00:19:38,025
And suddenly,

213
00:19:38,585 --> 00:19:41,385
my heart would feel empty.

214
00:19:49,385 --> 00:19:52,745
A balloon in hand, happiness in my heart.

215
00:19:55,225 --> 00:19:56,505
Balloons for sale!

216
00:19:57,145 --> 00:19:58,785
Tough balloons that won't pop easily.

217
00:21:15,505 --> 00:21:16,785
Hello?

218
00:21:16,865 --> 00:21:17,785
Ms. Shang.

219
00:21:17,865 --> 00:21:20,185
Your company registration
has been completed.

220
00:21:21,425 --> 00:21:22,385
Alright.

221
00:21:40,185 --> 00:21:41,985
I'd like to try a hiring experiment.

222
00:21:42,065 --> 00:21:43,705
I don't need you
to have a lot of experience.

223
00:21:43,785 --> 00:21:46,265
As long as you're willing to work hard
and fight alongside me.

224
00:21:46,345 --> 00:21:48,265
We'll probably be traveling a lot.

225
00:21:48,345 --> 00:21:49,185
It won't be easy.

226
00:21:49,265 --> 00:21:51,905
How does 7,000 a month sound?

227
00:21:52,505 --> 00:21:55,345
Seven thousand? I'd love that.

228
00:21:55,425 --> 00:21:57,745
Boss. You're my boss from now on.

229
00:21:58,385 --> 00:22:00,505
Why don't I start today?

230
00:22:00,585 --> 00:22:01,585
I've got nothing to do
if I go home anyway.

231
00:22:02,465 --> 00:22:03,585
Looking forward to it, Fu Dong.

232
00:22:04,185 --> 00:22:05,385
Likewise.

233
00:22:05,465 --> 00:22:06,705
Alright. Got it.

234
00:22:06,785 --> 00:22:07,785
Boss.

235
00:22:07,865 --> 00:22:08,785
Okay.

236
00:22:08,865 --> 00:22:10,345
I bought the car.

237
00:22:10,425 --> 00:22:11,985
Here's the key,

238
00:22:12,065 --> 00:22:14,105
the transfer papers,
and the inspection report.

239
00:22:14,185 --> 00:22:15,385
It's second-hand,

240
00:22:15,465 --> 00:22:17,505
but I think it'll last us
another three years.

241
00:22:17,585 --> 00:22:20,385
By then, you can drive,
and I'll ride shotgun.

242
00:22:20,465 --> 00:22:21,985
We'll take on the world together.

243
00:22:22,585 --> 00:22:24,145
Why am I the one driving?

244
00:22:25,225 --> 00:22:26,505
I don't have a license.

245
00:22:28,145 --> 00:22:29,105
I'll get one soon.

246
00:22:58,585 --> 00:23:00,705
QINGTAO CREATIVE EVENT STUDIO

247
00:23:00,785 --> 00:23:05,385
FOUNDER SHANG ZHITAO
SIX YEARS AT LIME ADVERTISING, BEIJING

248
00:23:08,505 --> 00:23:09,985
FOUNDER SHANG ZHITAO
SIX YEARS AT BEIJING LIME ADVERTISING

249
00:23:10,065 --> 00:23:11,345
ADVANCED STRATEGY

250
00:23:11,425 --> 00:23:12,665
S-TIER PROJECT LEAD

251
00:23:36,105 --> 00:23:37,145
Take care.

252
00:23:37,225 --> 00:23:38,425
Take care, Mr. Liu.

253
00:23:41,585 --> 00:23:43,185
Another deal done.

254
00:23:43,865 --> 00:23:45,665
Boss, how do you know everything?

255
00:23:45,745 --> 00:23:46,865
You're so cool.

256
00:23:47,665 --> 00:23:48,585
It's New Year's Eve.

257
00:23:48,665 --> 00:23:51,225
A few of the new hires and I
are getting together tonight.

258
00:23:51,305 --> 00:23:53,585
Want to join us?

259
00:23:53,665 --> 00:23:54,665
You guys pick whatever you want to eat.

260
00:23:54,745 --> 00:23:55,865
Bring me the receipt later.

261
00:23:56,745 --> 00:23:58,745
You're the best, boss!

262
00:24:00,345 --> 00:24:01,465
Come on. Go check it out.

263
00:24:01,985 --> 00:24:03,625
-Go on.
-Pick something good.

264
00:24:20,465 --> 00:24:22,265
RECIPIENT: FLORA SHANG

265
00:24:22,345 --> 00:24:24,065
HAPPY NEW YEAR
WISHING YOU ALL THE BEST

266
00:24:27,185 --> 00:24:29,145
SEND

267
00:24:53,385 --> 00:24:56,785
A balloon in hand, happiness in my heart.

268
00:24:59,505 --> 00:25:01,385
Balloons for sale!

269
00:25:01,985 --> 00:25:04,105
-Balloons!
-Mister, I'd like one balloon.

270
00:25:04,625 --> 00:25:05,625
Here you go.

271
00:26:37,665 --> 00:26:38,625
Hello?

272
00:26:40,905 --> 00:26:42,105
Sun Yu.

273
00:26:46,225 --> 00:26:47,385
Are you better now?

274
00:26:49,465 --> 00:26:50,305
I am.

275
00:26:50,905 --> 00:26:52,545
Let me give you an update.

276
00:26:52,625 --> 00:26:54,705
I bought a place.

277
00:26:54,785 --> 00:26:56,105
Just finished renovating it.

278
00:26:56,625 --> 00:27:01,345
I had a huge bookshelf

279
00:27:02,065 --> 00:27:04,225
and put all the books Sun Yuanzhu
gave me on it.

280
00:27:05,985 --> 00:27:07,025
Oh, right.

281
00:27:07,105 --> 00:27:09,105
I also started an event planning company.

282
00:27:09,185 --> 00:27:11,145
I've got a few employees.

283
00:27:11,225 --> 00:27:12,305
An event planning company?

284
00:27:13,025 --> 00:27:15,225
I'll have our marketing manager
contact you.

285
00:27:15,825 --> 00:27:18,985
We need new suppliers
for some offline events

286
00:27:19,065 --> 00:27:20,905
in your province.

287
00:27:22,345 --> 00:27:23,185
Sounds good.

288
00:27:24,425 --> 00:27:25,945
So,

289
00:27:27,385 --> 00:27:30,025
do you want to come visit me in Harbin?

290
00:27:30,825 --> 00:27:32,745
Sure. Works for me.

291
00:27:50,745 --> 00:27:51,585
Hello?

292
00:27:51,665 --> 00:27:53,985
Lumi, it's me.

293
00:27:54,065 --> 00:27:56,705
Want to come to Harbin for a few days?

294
00:27:56,785 --> 00:27:57,705
Send me the address.

295
00:27:57,785 --> 00:27:59,505
I'll head over in the next couple of days.

296
00:28:18,145 --> 00:28:19,225
I'M IN HIGH SPIRITS

297
00:28:19,305 --> 00:28:20,585
I CAME HOME WEARING A HAPPY SMILE

298
00:28:20,665 --> 00:28:21,905
SUN YUANZHU, REREAD IN 2016

299
00:28:27,945 --> 00:28:28,985
THE ONES WHO LEAVE AND THE ONES WHO STAY

300
00:28:59,265 --> 00:29:02,185
THOSE WHO LEFT, THOSE WHO STAYED

301
00:29:02,265 --> 00:29:04,145
OLD COUPLE'S TAVERN

302
00:29:04,225 --> 00:29:07,385
My last boss was always saying,

303
00:29:07,465 --> 00:29:09,905
"Fudong, you're so sloppy."

304
00:29:11,305 --> 00:29:12,385
I'm sloppy?

305
00:29:12,465 --> 00:29:15,225
His business wasn't worthy of my talents.

306
00:29:15,305 --> 00:29:17,825
It was all office politics.

307
00:29:19,785 --> 00:29:21,465
But after joining Boss Tao,

308
00:29:21,545 --> 00:29:23,105
I finally understood

309
00:29:23,185 --> 00:29:26,985
what world-class ad planning looks like.

310
00:29:27,585 --> 00:29:28,745
None of our clients

311
00:29:28,825 --> 00:29:32,265
has been dissatisfied
with any of my boss's proposals.

312
00:29:33,265 --> 00:29:34,305
Of course,

313
00:29:35,425 --> 00:29:38,745
I know I'm still lacking.

314
00:29:38,825 --> 00:29:40,745
-Well.
-After all, I don't have much experience.

315
00:29:40,825 --> 00:29:42,545
But you know what my boss always says?

316
00:29:43,385 --> 00:29:45,425
"I'm not afraid you don't know.

317
00:29:45,505 --> 00:29:47,745
I'm only afraid you won't learn."

318
00:29:48,265 --> 00:29:49,985
Come on. Here's to my boss.

319
00:29:50,065 --> 00:29:51,465
Keep it up, young man.

320
00:29:54,585 --> 00:29:56,625
Now that's the right attitude.
Shang Zhitao has really grown.

321
00:29:58,145 --> 00:30:00,145
Brother-in-law! What are you doing here?

322
00:30:00,225 --> 00:30:01,385
You're here too?

323
00:30:01,465 --> 00:30:02,985
I brought some colleagues for lunch.

324
00:30:03,065 --> 00:30:04,185
We'll head over first.

325
00:30:04,265 --> 00:30:05,665
What brings you here?

326
00:30:05,745 --> 00:30:07,345
Not busy today?

327
00:30:07,905 --> 00:30:08,945
You're here too.

328
00:30:09,025 --> 00:30:10,145
Let me introduce you.

329
00:30:11,145 --> 00:30:13,065
This is my best friend from Beijing.

330
00:30:13,145 --> 00:30:13,985
Xing Yi.

331
00:30:14,065 --> 00:30:15,385
-This is Lumi.
-Nice to meet you.

332
00:30:15,465 --> 00:30:16,345
-Nice to meet you too.
-I'm Xing Yi.

333
00:30:16,425 --> 00:30:17,545
I looked after her
when she was in Beijing.

334
00:30:19,585 --> 00:30:20,745
Go ahead and eat.

335
00:30:20,825 --> 00:30:22,505
-I'll check on my colleagues.
-Sure. Go ahead.

336
00:30:22,585 --> 00:30:23,425
Okay.

337
00:30:27,785 --> 00:30:29,465
They call him brother-in-law? Who's he?

338
00:30:29,545 --> 00:30:31,505
He's my middle school classmate.

339
00:30:32,225 --> 00:30:33,505
Fu Dong was just joking around.

340
00:30:33,585 --> 00:30:34,665
He’s just messing around.

341
00:30:36,945 --> 00:30:39,145
Xing Yi. Mr. Xing.

342
00:30:39,665 --> 00:30:41,145
He's a big shot around here.

343
00:30:42,785 --> 00:30:44,425
Long story short,

344
00:30:44,505 --> 00:30:47,905
he has introduced us
to a lot of great suppliers.

345
00:30:47,985 --> 00:30:50,905
He's taken really good care of my boss…

346
00:30:50,985 --> 00:30:52,065
I mean, my boss's tavern.

347
00:30:53,225 --> 00:30:54,505
He's just teasing.

348
00:30:55,185 --> 00:30:57,705
I have to head back to Beijing later.

349
00:30:57,785 --> 00:30:59,065
Don't miss me too much.

350
00:30:59,145 --> 00:31:00,305
Come on. Fill my glass.

351
00:31:00,825 --> 00:31:03,665
Since I'm here in the great Northeast,

352
00:31:03,745 --> 00:31:05,865
let's raise a toast to Boss Shang.

353
00:31:05,945 --> 00:31:06,825
And

354
00:31:07,705 --> 00:31:09,305
to Xing… Mr. Xing.

355
00:31:09,385 --> 00:31:10,945
-A toast to Mr. Xing.
-Cheers.

356
00:31:11,025 --> 00:31:12,185
-A toast to Mr. Xing.
-Cheers.

357
00:31:12,825 --> 00:31:14,945
-Come on.
-Why are you drinking tea?

358
00:31:15,025 --> 00:31:16,305
I'm driving later. Can't drink.

359
00:31:16,385 --> 00:31:17,705
-I'll drink tea instead.
-Come on.

360
00:31:17,785 --> 00:31:19,185
Let's drink till we drop.

361
00:31:19,265 --> 00:31:20,505
No problem.

362
00:31:29,305 --> 00:31:30,785
Alright. I'd better get going.

363
00:31:30,865 --> 00:31:32,745
Text me next time.

364
00:31:32,825 --> 00:31:33,745
I'll take you out for dinner sometime.

365
00:31:33,825 --> 00:31:35,345
Just the two of us.

366
00:31:35,425 --> 00:31:36,505
Okay.

367
00:31:36,585 --> 00:31:37,665
Don't come out. It's chilly.

368
00:31:37,745 --> 00:31:38,785
-Bye.
-Bye-bye.

369
00:31:42,865 --> 00:31:44,505
Why did you come down, Mom?
I can clean everything myself.

370
00:31:50,345 --> 00:31:54,825
What's going on between you and Xing Yi?

371
00:31:54,905 --> 00:31:55,785
Hold your horses.

372
00:31:55,865 --> 00:31:57,785
Don't start imagining things.
We've known each other for too long.

373
00:31:59,425 --> 00:32:00,265
Look at you.

374
00:32:01,265 --> 00:32:04,745
Well, you're not getting any younger.

375
00:32:05,425 --> 00:32:07,025
If things aren't happening with Xing Yi,

376
00:32:07,105 --> 00:32:10,065
you're going on blind dates
starting tomorrow.

377
00:32:11,425 --> 00:32:12,265
Mom.

378
00:32:13,785 --> 00:32:16,425
Do you only think I'm doing well
if I get married?

379
00:32:18,305 --> 00:32:20,265
That's not what I mean.

380
00:32:21,025 --> 00:32:22,185
I just mean

381
00:32:22,265 --> 00:32:25,905
you haven't gotten over
your last relationship.

382
00:32:26,945 --> 00:32:31,025
I read online that the best way
to get over an old relationship

383
00:32:31,105 --> 00:32:33,705
is to start a new one.

384
00:32:33,785 --> 00:32:34,625
Right?

385
00:32:34,705 --> 00:32:35,825
No matter what,

386
00:32:35,905 --> 00:32:38,025
whether it was good or bad,
you've broken up.

387
00:32:38,105 --> 00:32:41,385
Now you have to keep loving life

388
00:32:41,465 --> 00:32:43,145
and love the person
who deserves your love.

389
00:32:43,225 --> 00:32:44,625
Don't you think?

390
00:32:46,265 --> 00:32:48,185
I just don't like blind dates.

391
00:32:48,265 --> 00:32:49,705
It has nothing to do with him.

392
00:32:51,025 --> 00:32:53,145
Love is all about fate.

393
00:32:53,225 --> 00:32:55,785
Maybe I'll get married. Maybe I won't.

394
00:32:55,865 --> 00:32:56,945
For now,

395
00:32:57,025 --> 00:33:00,025
I just want to get to know someone slowly
and let things happen naturally.

396
00:33:00,105 --> 00:33:01,185
Does that sound okay?

397
00:33:04,545 --> 00:33:05,825
Okay.

398
00:33:05,905 --> 00:33:07,785
Then your dad and I will save up
a little more for you.

399
00:33:07,865 --> 00:33:08,705
-Alright?
-Alright.

400
00:33:09,305 --> 00:33:10,385
We'll save together.

401
00:33:12,825 --> 00:33:14,105
Leave them. I'll carry them.

402
00:33:28,385 --> 00:33:29,225
Come in.

403
00:33:31,225 --> 00:33:33,705
Boss, I heard you're back.

404
00:33:34,305 --> 00:33:35,785
I have something to tell you.

405
00:33:37,305 --> 00:33:38,185
Go on.

406
00:33:41,145 --> 00:33:43,265
I've got a project.

407
00:33:43,345 --> 00:33:44,465
You might want to take a look.

408
00:33:45,145 --> 00:33:47,185
What kind of project needs my attention?

409
00:33:49,145 --> 00:33:50,545
Bring it to your boss, Will.

410
00:33:51,745 --> 00:33:52,585
Here's the thing.

411
00:33:53,225 --> 00:33:56,105
I've got an international summit
for a beer brand.

412
00:33:56,185 --> 00:33:57,625
They want an offline event.

413
00:33:57,705 --> 00:34:00,145
I picked Harbin,

414
00:34:01,145 --> 00:34:02,465
but Will is against it.

415
00:34:02,545 --> 00:34:05,505
I think Harbin has huge potential.

416
00:34:05,585 --> 00:34:07,105
It's worth investing in.

417
00:34:09,665 --> 00:34:12,185
I printed out the supplier rankings.

418
00:34:12,264 --> 00:34:15,824
I think the top one
deserves a closer look.

419
00:34:19,945 --> 00:34:20,985
HARBIN BEER INTERNATIONAL SUMMIT
SUPPLIER OVERVIEW

420
00:34:21,065 --> 00:34:22,505
SHANG ZHITAO

421
00:34:22,585 --> 00:34:24,025
HARBIN QINGTAO CREATIVE EVENT STUDIO

422
00:34:34,385 --> 00:34:36,465
Leave the list here.
I'll look at it myself.

423
00:34:37,545 --> 00:34:38,385
You got it.

424
00:34:39,025 --> 00:34:40,065
Lumi.

425
00:34:41,505 --> 00:34:44,025
I'm in on this project
from start to finish.

426
00:34:44,625 --> 00:34:45,545
You bet.

427
00:35:04,385 --> 00:35:05,665
Lumi, long time no see.

428
00:35:05,745 --> 00:35:06,705
-Fu Dong.
-You've lost weight.

429
00:35:06,785 --> 00:35:07,625
Nah.

430
00:35:11,705 --> 00:35:12,665
This is our boss, Luke.

431
00:35:14,305 --> 00:35:15,825
Hello, Mr. Luan.

432
00:35:16,425 --> 00:35:18,385
I'm Ms. Shang's assistant.

433
00:35:18,465 --> 00:35:19,345
My name is Fu Dong.

434
00:35:22,585 --> 00:35:23,825
Where's Ms. Shang?

435
00:35:23,905 --> 00:35:25,305
The summit is around the corner.

436
00:35:25,385 --> 00:35:26,945
She's been working around the clock
these past few days.

437
00:35:27,025 --> 00:35:28,825
She insists on handling
a lot of things herself.

438
00:35:28,905 --> 00:35:31,705
She's probably at the venue now.

439
00:35:31,785 --> 00:35:33,065
When can we see her?

440
00:35:34,545 --> 00:35:37,425
I'll give her a call and see.
Give me a minute.

441
00:35:37,505 --> 00:35:39,745
Why don't we check into the hotel
and get some rest in the meantime?

442
00:35:39,825 --> 00:35:41,865
If you need anything during your stay,
just let me know.

443
00:35:42,385 --> 00:35:43,225
Alright.

444
00:35:51,825 --> 00:35:52,865
Lumi.

445
00:35:52,945 --> 00:35:55,305
What's the plan for tomorrow?

446
00:35:55,385 --> 00:35:56,545
Everything is set.

447
00:35:56,625 --> 00:35:58,905
I also arranged a few local media outlets.

448
00:35:58,985 --> 00:36:01,065
Think of it as my gift to you.

449
00:36:01,145 --> 00:36:04,105
By the way,
the day after is all arranged too.

450
00:36:04,185 --> 00:36:05,745
I'll go over everything again
tomorrow night.

451
00:36:06,345 --> 00:36:08,185
Come see me when you're done.

452
00:36:08,825 --> 00:36:11,545
I can't meet with you today.
Go enjoy yourself.

453
00:36:11,625 --> 00:36:16,265
Tomorrow, I'll give Lime
the most elegant and luxurious summit.

454
00:36:17,185 --> 00:36:18,185
I believe you.

455
00:36:21,025 --> 00:36:21,865
She's not coming.

456
00:37:58,145 --> 00:37:58,985
Tao.

457
00:37:59,865 --> 00:38:00,945
Lumi.

458
00:38:01,025 --> 00:38:02,025
Great work.

459
00:38:04,025 --> 00:38:05,625
I was watching the rehearsal
for quite a while just now.

460
00:38:05,705 --> 00:38:07,145
Where's the host?

461
00:38:08,065 --> 00:38:09,065
I'm the host.

462
00:38:09,825 --> 00:38:10,665
Stop kidding.

463
00:38:10,745 --> 00:38:13,105
I'm not kidding. I'm the host.

464
00:38:14,385 --> 00:38:15,505
It's an international summit,

465
00:38:15,585 --> 00:38:18,265
broadcast live across five countries
in three languages.

466
00:38:18,345 --> 00:38:19,185
Can you handle that?

467
00:38:19,905 --> 00:38:21,345
That's exactly why.

468
00:38:21,425 --> 00:38:23,625
Hiring someone from Beijing
would've cost me 20,000.

469
00:38:23,705 --> 00:38:25,945
I figured I might as well do it myself.
I can save the money.

470
00:38:26,025 --> 00:38:27,025
I'm telling you,

471
00:38:27,105 --> 00:38:28,705
I wanted this summit to be held in Harbin.

472
00:38:28,785 --> 00:38:29,905
Those are all my biggest clients.

473
00:38:29,985 --> 00:38:31,025
Don't embarrass me.

474
00:38:31,105 --> 00:38:32,585
Have faith in me, okay?

475
00:38:32,665 --> 00:38:34,465
-Really?
-Of course.

476
00:38:34,985 --> 00:38:36,345
I've got to get ready.

477
00:38:47,825 --> 00:38:48,745
Long time no see.

478
00:39:03,065 --> 00:39:04,465
FROM THE SNOW CITY
THE WORLD IN PURSUIT

479
00:39:55,745 --> 00:39:56,585
Boss.

480
00:39:57,105 --> 00:39:59,705
Lime's Mr. Luan wants an iced Americano.

481
00:39:59,785 --> 00:40:01,505
We only have hot coffee.

482
00:40:01,585 --> 00:40:02,865
The event's about to start.

483
00:40:02,945 --> 00:40:04,625
Where are we supposed to get
an iced Americano now?

484
00:40:04,705 --> 00:40:05,665
He's pretty demanding.

485
00:40:06,745 --> 00:40:07,985
What should I do then?
How do we deal with him?

486
00:40:08,065 --> 00:40:09,785
It's too late to buy one.

487
00:40:09,865 --> 00:40:11,465
Just apologize and tell him
we don't have it.

488
00:40:12,945 --> 00:40:14,025
Will that work?

489
00:40:14,105 --> 00:40:17,625
Didn't you always say
we should meet every client request?

490
00:40:17,705 --> 00:40:20,065
Knowing when to say no
to unreasonable client demands

491
00:40:20,145 --> 00:40:21,625
is also part of your job.

492
00:40:28,065 --> 00:40:30,185
INTERNATIONAL BEER INDUSTRY SUMMIT

493
00:40:30,265 --> 00:40:32,705
Good afternoon, friends.

494
00:40:32,785 --> 00:40:34,585
The northern land is covered in snow,

495
00:40:34,665 --> 00:40:36,225
but the heart burns with warmth.

496
00:40:44,945 --> 00:40:47,705
Good afternoon, friends.

497
00:40:47,785 --> 00:40:50,585
The northern land is covered in snow,

498
00:40:50,665 --> 00:40:52,945
but the heart burns with warmth.

499
00:40:54,625 --> 00:40:56,505
Lime thanks everyone for joining us

500
00:40:56,585 --> 00:40:59,425
in this ice and snow adventure.

501
00:41:06,265 --> 00:41:10,745
Lime thanks everyone for joining us

502
00:41:10,825 --> 00:41:13,665
in this ice and snow adventure.

503
00:41:19,105 --> 00:41:21,785
-Welcome to Harbin.
-Xing Yi, what are you doing here?

504
00:41:21,865 --> 00:41:23,665
Tao asked me to help out.

505
00:41:24,185 --> 00:41:26,025
The owner of this hotel
is a friend of mine.

506
00:41:44,505 --> 00:41:46,305
I study English every weekend.

507
00:41:46,385 --> 00:41:49,025
I have to keep learning
so I can be worthy of being part of Lime.

508
00:42:19,945 --> 00:42:21,225
As expected of my mentee.

509
00:42:21,745 --> 00:42:22,705
She's a genius.

510
00:42:25,345 --> 00:42:27,265
She's not just a genius.

511
00:42:28,705 --> 00:42:30,345
She's also the hardest-working person
I've met.

512
00:42:34,545 --> 00:42:39,145
Now, please welcome
Lime's Global Senior President, Luke,

513
00:42:39,225 --> 00:42:40,465
to the stage to say a few words.

514
00:43:38,385 --> 00:43:39,745
You did a good job.

515
00:43:39,825 --> 00:43:41,665
Don't tell me you've learned Italian too.

516
00:43:41,745 --> 00:43:43,065
Stop teasing me.

517
00:43:43,145 --> 00:43:44,945
-Was it that bad?
-My car’s parked in the basement.

518
00:43:45,025 --> 00:43:45,985
It was great.

519
00:43:46,065 --> 00:43:47,545
-You scared me, though.
-Tao.

520
00:43:48,105 --> 00:43:49,065
Drink your medicine.

521
00:43:49,865 --> 00:43:50,705
Thanks.

522
00:43:50,785 --> 00:43:52,025
Why are you taking Chinese medicine?

523
00:43:52,105 --> 00:43:53,665
My hormones are a little out of balance.

524
00:43:53,745 --> 00:43:54,625
I'm trying to get them back on track.

525
00:43:55,145 --> 00:43:56,745
Get some rest.

526
00:43:56,825 --> 00:43:58,785
Once everything wraps up here,
let's go grab some barbecue.

527
00:44:02,345 --> 00:44:03,185
We'll talk later.

528
00:44:03,265 --> 00:44:04,705
-I've got to go.
-You… But he…

529
00:44:04,785 --> 00:44:05,785
-You…
-Let's go.

530
00:44:13,665 --> 00:44:14,585
Mr. Xing.

531
00:44:15,825 --> 00:44:16,825
Are you leaving?

532
00:44:16,905 --> 00:44:18,225
I apologize if I've missed anything.

533
00:44:18,745 --> 00:44:20,065
Aren't you cold? You're wearing so little.

534
00:44:20,145 --> 00:44:21,345
Not at all.

535
00:44:27,985 --> 00:44:29,505
Do you still love Shang Zhitao or not?

536
00:44:30,905 --> 00:44:32,905
Is that even the point anymore?

537
00:44:34,225 --> 00:44:35,705
Can't you see she's more ruthless
than I am?

538
00:44:39,305 --> 00:44:40,865
Looks like Dong's boss
is about to have a boyfriend.

539
00:44:40,945 --> 00:44:42,905
Apparently, my friend is about
to have a boyfriend too.

540
00:44:43,825 --> 00:44:45,065
Do you have her home address?

541
00:44:45,825 --> 00:44:47,705
No, I don't have it.

542
00:44:47,785 --> 00:44:50,305
But I've already sent you

543
00:44:50,825 --> 00:44:52,425
the address of her parents' tavern.

544
00:44:56,225 --> 00:44:57,745
Do you know

545
00:44:58,385 --> 00:44:59,825
why you haven't been fired
all these years?

546
00:45:00,465 --> 00:45:02,465
-Why?
-Because you're smart.

547
00:45:04,265 --> 00:45:05,585
I'm more than just smart.

548
00:45:07,105 --> 00:45:08,025
If the mountain won't come to me,

549
00:45:08,545 --> 00:45:09,585
I'll go to the mountain.

550
00:45:12,825 --> 00:45:14,665
We should all keep learning.

551
00:45:15,185 --> 00:45:17,225
Learn English and French,

552
00:45:17,305 --> 00:45:19,625
and learn how to love.

